Interpretation: the Lodi source is a Kindergarten-filtered meal-program eligibility report covering 7/29/2025-5/29/2026. Highest Eligible and Last Day are identical at all 31 reported schools. The report-side quantity is therefore retained as useful source-triangulation evidence, but not as an independently validated annual attendance denominator. It does not identify student-specific expected attendance days and does not adjudicate between the Census and cumulative-enrollment annual proxy constructions.
